          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 144779,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What do attributes do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">They add additional information to tags</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Attributes create game loops</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">They spawn enemies</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Attributes create levels</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">They add additional information to tags.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 144780,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How does the link appear in the browser?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Wiki\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Video_game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Video game\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"em\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Video game</code> as a link with emphasis</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> as a normal link</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Video game</code> with emphasis but with a broken link</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>&lt;em&gt;Video game&lt;/em&gt;</code> as a link</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Video game</code> as a link with emphasis.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 144781,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this code?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/game-controls&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Game Controls\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The attribute name should be <code>href</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It has no text between <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> and <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nothing's wrong with the code</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">The opening tag <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> is missing</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The attribute name should be <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 144782,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the code to make it work properly.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/level-1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Click to start Level 1!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"65\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>&lt;/a&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 144783,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the correct attribute to the opening <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> tag.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Welcome to the Arcade!\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"h3\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/high-scores&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\" Take a look at the high\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   scores here! \" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>href</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 144784,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What's wrong with this <code>img</code> element?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/sprites/player.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">The tag should have <code>img</code> as the tag name, not the <code>a</code> tag</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nothing</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">The <code>img</code> element is missing a closing tag</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">It's missing a URL to access the image</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">The tag should have <code>img</code> as the tag name, not the <code>a</code> tag.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 144785,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the <code>width</code> attribute in this image tag to <code>\"300\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/player-sprite.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>\"300\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 144786,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the <code>height</code> attribute of this image tag to <code>\"200\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\" name=\"index.html\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/enemy-sprite.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;200&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"45\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>height=\"200\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 144787,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How many <code>img</code> elements does this code have?</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"Player Sprite\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"p\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/player.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"br\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"href\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;https://example.com/sprites&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /><text value=\"More sprites\" /><text value=\"&lt;/\" /><text value=\"a\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">One</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Two</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Three</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick One.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 144788,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Set the <code>height</code> and <code>width</code> attributes so that the height is bigger than the width.</p><code name=\"index.html\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"html\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"src\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"href\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"39\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\"img\" class=\"name\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"src\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;/img/boss-sprite.png&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"height\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;300&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"width\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\"&quot;220&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"300\"</code>, followed by <code>\"220\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
